<para>The function that is passed in is first stored in a shared_ptr. After this, the shared_ptr is added to the vector of listener functions, which leads to a implicit conversion to a weak_ptr. The shared_ptr is then returned to the Listener that has called this function to be stored in a vector of shared_ptr&lt;void&gt; <ref refid="a00419" kindref="compound">listener.hh</ref>.</para>
